spans.s:
उन्-√ नम् (उद्-√ नम्) P. -नमति, to bend upwards, raise one's self, rise, ascend, Prab.; Mṛcch.; Pañcat.; Bhartṛ. &c.;
to raise up, lift up, Pañcat. :
Caus. -नमयति, or -नामयति, to bend upwards, raise, erect, elevate, MBh.; R.; Śak.; Kathās. &c.

उन्-√ नह् (उद्-√ नह्) P. -नह्यति, to tie up, bind up;
to free from fetters or ties, push out, Suśr.; Kauś.;
to free one's self from fetters, rush out, get out, MBh.
